  Description: Prerequisite Region - Golden Road You're at home blazing trails in
    the burning sands, and you made a living guiding or following creatures in the
    desert. You might be a native nomad, an experienced desert guide, a naturalist,
    a bandit driven into the dunes by the law-or all of the above. Choose two attribute
    boosts. One must be to Constitution or Wisdom , and one is a free attribute boost.
    You're trained in the Survival skill and the Desert Lore skill. You gain the
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Experienced Tracker] skill feat.
